import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Learn why Everyday Decision Tools makes simple, transparent calculators for everyday costs and purchase decisions.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container narrow"><div class="eyebrow">About us</div><h1>Good decisions start<br />with <em>clear information.</em></h1><p class="lead">We make everyday math easier to understand, so you can spend less time guessing and more time feeling confident in your choices.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container prose narrow"><h2>Useful tools, without the noise</h2><p>Everyday Decision Tools is a collection of straightforward calculators for common money and purchase questions. Whether you are comparing package sizes, estimating a road trip, or checking the real cost of a subscription, our goal is to make the answer easier to see.</p><h2>Simple by design</h2><p>Our calculators are designed to be quick, understandable, and usable on any device. You do not need an account, and calculations run locally in your browser. We do not need your personal financial information to provide a result.</p><h2>Transparent estimates</h2><p>Calculators are only as useful as their assumptions. We explain what each tool uses and where estimates may differ from real-world costs. Always consider taxes, fees, changing prices, and your own circumstances when making a purchase decision.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/tools/">Explore the calculators →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
